WEBVTT

00:11.010 --> 00:14.597
I'm going to return
to the hometown we lost.

00:16.391 --> 00:18.101
That's all I care about now.

00:19.728 --> 00:22.731
I chose to be a soldier,
hoping I would join the Military Police

00:22.814 --> 00:24.983
so I could work in the safety
of the interior.

00:26.443 --> 00:28.361
Why do you want to be a soldier?

00:31.406 --> 00:32.365
I...

00:33.241 --> 00:34.868
I decided I must kill them.

00:36.077 --> 00:39.414
That I must slaughter all the Titans...

00:40.248 --> 00:42.542
with my own hands.

00:57.390 --> 00:59.476
So your encounter with the Titans

01:00.185 --> 01:02.562
didn't break your will?

01:04.647 --> 01:06.274
You'll be able to do it.

01:07.233 --> 01:09.652
Eren Jaeger, was it?

01:17.702 --> 01:22.749
You damn traitors!

03:15.820 --> 03:16.821
Eren!

03:24.621 --> 03:25.663
If only...

03:26.915 --> 03:29.208
If only I had cut off their heads!

03:30.543 --> 03:32.086
That was the perfect chance!

03:32.712 --> 03:35.423
I should've been able to do it, so why...

03:40.929 --> 03:42.096
That was it.

03:42.347 --> 03:44.265
There won't be another chance!

03:52.857 --> 03:54.442
Everyone, jump off the wall!

04:02.867 --> 04:04.410
It got Ymir!

04:06.537 --> 04:08.164
And it got somebody else, too!

04:11.584 --> 04:12.752
He ate them!

04:15.630 --> 04:17.257
This can't be...

04:19.133 --> 04:20.134
Bertholdt...

04:32.272 --> 04:34.399
Soldiers, prepare to attack!

04:34.857 --> 04:36.734
We're taking down the Colossal Titan!

04:37.235 --> 04:39.153
It's a threat to all of humanity!

04:39.946 --> 04:41.906
Swarm the giant bastard!

05:04.262 --> 05:06.389
Just like the reports said, he's slow!

05:07.056 --> 05:08.808
It might be a giant, but that's all it is!

05:09.100 --> 05:12.603
Compared to the other Titans
we normally fight, this will be easy!

05:13.187 --> 05:14.147
We've got this!

05:14.605 --> 05:17.025
Now's our chance! Cut his neck!

05:22.864 --> 05:24.032
It's too hot!

05:24.449 --> 05:26.576
Everyone, fall back!

05:33.875 --> 05:34.959
My hand!

05:35.043 --> 05:36.961
Water! Bring water!

05:38.463 --> 05:40.089
Is he trying to disappear again?

05:40.590 --> 05:42.592
No, something is different.

05:43.676 --> 05:45.511
The last time, he vanished instantly.

05:45.970 --> 05:50.475
But now he's maintaining his form
and emitting heat like a furnace.

05:51.184 --> 05:53.352
If he keeps protecting himself
with this steam...

05:57.273 --> 05:59.442
we'll be unable to attack him
with ODM gear!

05:59.734 --> 06:01.527
What do we do?

06:02.737 --> 06:04.906
We can't do anything. We must wait.

06:06.157 --> 06:09.243
Squads Three and Four,
take position behind the target.

06:09.535 --> 06:10.745
Rashad is in command.

06:10.870 --> 06:11.913
Got it!

06:12.163 --> 06:13.664
Squad Two will wait here.

06:14.248 --> 06:15.666
Lauda is in command.

06:16.000 --> 06:16.918
Understood!

06:17.960 --> 06:21.214
Let's see how long
he can keep his body burning.

06:21.547 --> 06:23.049
He has to come out eventually.

06:23.716 --> 06:25.718
We wait for that moment to attack.

06:26.344 --> 06:27.386
Listen up.

06:28.012 --> 06:29.806
Forget about capturing them.

06:30.431 --> 06:32.391
Kill them without hesitation!

06:36.437 --> 06:39.565
Armin and Squad One, follow me!

06:40.191 --> 06:41.818
We've got a date with the Armored Titan!

06:43.319 --> 06:44.195
Hot!

06:44.320 --> 06:46.823
Christa! Conny! Get further back!

06:48.241 --> 06:50.535
And take care
of those two injured soldiers.

06:51.077 --> 06:52.203
Wait!

06:53.955 --> 06:56.082
Ymir can't possibly be dead yet.

06:57.041 --> 06:59.502
Please rescue her!

07:00.586 --> 07:01.504
Right.

07:02.088 --> 07:04.257
Where are Reiner and Bertholdt?

07:05.675 --> 07:08.427
They don't even have their ODM gear!

07:09.220 --> 07:12.014
Please find those two and help them!

07:42.545 --> 07:43.754
You piece of shit...

07:44.255 --> 07:46.090
You big piece of shit.

07:46.924 --> 07:49.760
You were always yapping
about a soldier's duty.

07:50.303 --> 07:51.846
During close combat training,

07:52.430 --> 07:54.974
were you deliberately holding back on me?

07:56.267 --> 07:58.686
You're so strong, it's ridiculous.

07:59.645 --> 08:01.898
I can't even move an inch of my body.

08:06.402 --> 08:09.280
I always thought
you were the one to look up to.

08:10.656 --> 08:13.284
Someone who remained calm,
regardless of the situation...

08:13.910 --> 08:17.288
A guy who put the interests
of his comrades ahead of his own.

08:18.581 --> 08:19.499
And I...

08:20.583 --> 08:25.379
To think that I once wished
to be as strong as you one day.

08:32.345 --> 08:33.471
That did nothing!

08:38.267 --> 08:39.727
Eren's attack didn't...

08:40.937 --> 08:42.730
And my blades don't work either?

08:46.692 --> 08:49.946
What's worse, unlike Annie,
his whole body is hard!

08:54.408 --> 08:55.284
Eren!

09:00.540 --> 09:02.500
Hey, Reiner...

09:04.252 --> 09:08.923
I don't know what kind of face
you're making right now, but...

09:12.510 --> 09:16.264
You guys really are
the worst pieces of shit.

09:17.848 --> 09:22.853
I bet that in the history of mankind,
nobody's done anything as terrible as you.

09:32.530 --> 09:33.948
I've got to erase you.

09:34.407 --> 09:37.285
You shouldn't be allowed to exist anymore.

09:38.744 --> 09:40.580
What the hell are you thinking?

09:41.205 --> 09:43.374
I've never felt this disgusted before.

09:43.791 --> 09:48.129
Recalling you and your self-righteous face
makes me sick.

09:50.256 --> 09:52.174
It makes me want to throw up.

09:52.758 --> 09:56.095
You damn pest!

09:58.014 --> 10:00.725
It's time to exterminate you!

10:12.820 --> 10:14.322
Damn, that hurt, Annie!

10:15.781 --> 10:18.576
Haven't you ever heard
about "pulling your punches"?

10:18.993 --> 10:21.537
I did that because you were coming at me
at full force.

10:21.912 --> 10:24.540
I had to counter it
with the same strength.

10:25.416 --> 10:27.084
And you're a guy.

10:27.668 --> 10:32.173
Aren't you supposed to be gentle
with this delicate body of mine?

10:32.506 --> 10:35.551
What? Your jokes aren't funny at all.

10:36.302 --> 10:37.553
If strength is the deciding factor,

10:37.762 --> 10:40.931
then why am I on my ass
and you're still standing?

10:41.599 --> 10:42.642
Well...

10:45.895 --> 10:47.813
I didn't throw you using my strength.

10:48.606 --> 10:53.319
It's a technique used to protect yourself
against an opponent stronger than you.

10:55.988 --> 10:58.824
If I were you,
I'd think about learning it.

10:59.158 --> 11:00.242
All right, already!

11:00.534 --> 11:01.911
Why don't we take a break?

11:14.423 --> 11:15.341
Annie!

11:15.758 --> 11:16.926
I surrender!

11:17.259 --> 11:18.469
I surrender!

11:18.719 --> 11:19.678
"Surrender"?

11:19.929 --> 11:22.848
Try to learn something first
before you surrender.

11:23.224 --> 11:27.144
Learn how to use your strength
and how to talk to women properly.

11:27.269 --> 11:30.147
All right! I promise I'll learn,
so let go already!

11:30.272 --> 11:33.192
Really? How desperate are you to learn it?

11:42.868 --> 11:44.912
Why the hell
did Reiner come flying this way?

11:45.371 --> 11:46.288
Hey, Annie.

11:47.373 --> 11:49.542
I want to learn that move, too.

11:51.001 --> 11:52.211
Teach me.

11:56.799 --> 11:57.925
I don't know...

11:58.509 --> 12:00.511
That move is meant to be used on humans,

12:01.137 --> 12:03.556
so I don't think it's of any use to you.

12:04.432 --> 12:08.269
But I'm interested to see if it works

12:09.145 --> 12:10.312
on a beast like you.

12:11.564 --> 12:13.774
Are you serious? It's happening...

12:14.483 --> 12:15.568
Hey!

12:16.235 --> 12:17.695
Are they going at it?

12:17.820 --> 12:19.155
It's the big showdown!

12:19.238 --> 12:20.865
-Who will win?!
-Annie, you think?

12:20.990 --> 12:22.408
What? Are you stupid?

12:22.658 --> 12:24.410
I bet my whole dinner on Mikasa!

12:24.785 --> 12:26.328
What do you think, Eren?

12:28.205 --> 12:29.123
I...

12:34.587 --> 12:35.921
Which one, I wonder?

12:45.097 --> 12:47.683
How did that turn out in the end?

12:48.517 --> 12:51.061
No... Why am I recalling it now?

12:51.604 --> 12:54.815
Is this what they call
"having your life flash before your eyes"?

12:56.984 --> 12:59.445
Who gives a damn anymore?

13:00.446 --> 13:04.492
I don't think I've felt this awful
in my whole life.

13:05.659 --> 13:06.494
Eren!

13:06.744 --> 13:09.497
Don't do it! You can't defeat him!

13:10.164 --> 13:11.624
Run this way!

13:11.874 --> 13:14.084
Eren! Don't try to fight him!

13:23.302 --> 13:24.220
Eren!

13:25.596 --> 13:26.514
This is bad!

13:26.805 --> 13:27.932
Did he lose control?

13:51.080 --> 13:52.581
He pinned the Armored Titan to the ground!

13:52.998 --> 13:54.708
Wait. Isn't that...

13:55.668 --> 13:57.169
Isn't that the technique Annie used?

13:58.295 --> 14:03.342
I don't know what you guys are trying
to accomplish by doing all this, but...

14:03.842 --> 14:08.347
Now that I think of it, your plan
has been flawed from the start!

14:09.890 --> 14:11.767
That was your biggest mistake.

14:12.268 --> 14:15.479
You should've thought twice
about teaching me how to fight!

14:18.607 --> 14:21.026
It's working! I've got him now!

14:21.652 --> 14:22.945
I still have a chance!

14:27.658 --> 14:28.742
Think again!

14:32.872 --> 14:33.873
Eren!

14:34.456 --> 14:36.375
You're not getting away from this!

14:53.100 --> 14:54.059
He did it!

15:02.401 --> 15:03.819
Eren! Can you hear me?

15:04.778 --> 15:07.406
Run away! Get closer to the wall!

15:08.115 --> 15:11.243
Their goal is to kidnap you
and take you away!

15:11.911 --> 15:14.538
We have to escape
and prevent that from happening!

15:16.123 --> 15:19.919
But Armin, Reiner isn't going
to let us do as we please!

15:27.051 --> 15:29.094
It's dangerous here! Get back, you two!

16:00.376 --> 16:02.461
Nice, Eren! Good call!

16:03.253 --> 16:04.463
He's back to normal.

16:05.089 --> 16:10.386
Right, but like you said,
it will be impossible to escape Reiner.

16:19.895 --> 16:21.021
What the hell?

16:24.441 --> 16:26.819
I knew it. The Colossal Titan.

16:27.319 --> 16:29.655
Why did that bastard show up here?

16:32.658 --> 16:33.617
Where's Eren?

16:34.201 --> 16:35.327
What's the situation?

16:36.412 --> 16:37.997
Eren and the others went that way!

16:44.461 --> 16:45.295
Eren?

16:45.838 --> 16:47.881
Is that Eren's Titan form?

16:48.674 --> 16:49.675
Listen up, Eren.

16:50.009 --> 16:53.262
If you're going to escape,
we've got to find a way to stop Reiner

16:53.387 --> 16:55.222
and buy you some time!

16:56.223 --> 17:00.394
Can you break his leg
with another one of those joint locks?

17:01.562 --> 17:03.731
Our blades don't seem to work on him.

17:04.064 --> 17:07.609
So use your head and figure out
the best course of action!

17:19.413 --> 17:20.289
Mikasa!

17:20.789 --> 17:22.750
Use these, my remaining blades.

17:23.792 --> 17:24.793
I'm counting on you!

17:29.048 --> 17:32.634
This time, running away
means a guaranteed victory.

17:32.885 --> 17:36.263
You are the ones who are screwed
for revealing what you are.

17:36.930 --> 17:39.808
You're the ones
who have been backed into a corner.

17:52.071 --> 17:52.905
He's fast!

17:57.576 --> 17:58.494
Shit!

17:58.619 --> 18:00.162
Leg! His leg!

18:03.540 --> 18:05.417
Don't stay on the ground! Eren!

18:05.667 --> 18:06.543
Stand up!

18:11.256 --> 18:14.009
Damn it! His tackle is too much to handle!

18:16.845 --> 18:19.932
Damn. When did he become so swift?

18:20.349 --> 18:22.101
Are we completely useless here?

18:23.268 --> 18:24.144
No...

18:24.436 --> 18:27.189
If his entire body is hard like stone,

18:27.815 --> 18:29.900
there's no way he can move like that.

18:30.651 --> 18:32.861
In the past,
the armor they use during wars

18:33.529 --> 18:37.157
had sections at the joints that weren't
covered in metal to allow for movement.

18:38.117 --> 18:39.910
Like at the armpits and groin.

18:40.536 --> 18:41.411
And also,

18:42.079 --> 18:43.372
the spot behind the knee.

18:46.917 --> 18:48.210
I can't evade it.

18:49.586 --> 18:51.547
I'll get knocked over anyway...

18:52.798 --> 18:53.757
Bring it on!

18:55.259 --> 18:56.510
Give me that neck!

18:57.845 --> 18:59.930
You're mine!

19:04.893 --> 19:07.437
Yes! That's it, Eren!

19:07.646 --> 19:10.482
I've got him!
Now, it's a battle of strength!

19:13.193 --> 19:14.194
This freak...

19:15.821 --> 19:16.697
Not enough!

19:26.540 --> 19:27.416
Mikasa!

19:28.876 --> 19:29.793
She cut him!

19:35.674 --> 19:37.843
He can't fight back anymore!

19:47.227 --> 19:48.312
You've got this!

19:48.687 --> 19:50.063
Go for it, Eren!

19:50.772 --> 19:52.733
Pull his head off his neck!

19:53.066 --> 19:55.402
Send the traitor out of there!

19:58.113 --> 19:59.281
I can win!

19:59.865 --> 20:01.116
Against Reiner...

20:01.491 --> 20:02.618
I can win!

20:16.173 --> 20:17.090
What the...

20:18.133 --> 20:18.967
It's useless.

20:19.134 --> 20:21.136
Keep at it! Don't let up!

20:31.355 --> 20:32.439
He stopped.

20:34.816 --> 20:35.984
But why there?

20:52.167 --> 20:55.087
Be on your guard! He's calling in Titans!

21:03.679 --> 21:05.639
No other Titans spotted in the area!

21:06.181 --> 21:07.432
All this struggle for nothing.

21:08.016 --> 21:10.727
Try screaming for help
with your head ripped off, you idiot!

21:10.852 --> 21:12.229
Look, he's tearing it off!

21:13.897 --> 21:15.607
What's with the Armored Titan?

21:16.191 --> 21:18.151
Why did he scream like that?

21:27.536 --> 21:28.578
Hey...

21:29.204 --> 21:30.914
Hey!

21:43.969 --> 21:46.763
Above you! Look out!

23:25.737 --> 23:27.823
The battle between Eren
and the Armored Titan

23:27.906 --> 23:29.574
comes to an abrupt conclusion.

23:30.408 --> 23:31.952
Mikasa gets injured

23:32.327 --> 23:35.455
 when the Colossal Titan
falls from the wall.

23:35.789 --> 23:37.541
Hannes comes running to her.

23:38.208 --> 23:40.627
To protect Eren
from his own reckless behavior

23:41.503 --> 23:43.880
and to stand proudly by his side

23:44.673 --> 23:48.677
have always been
Mikasa and Armin's wishes.

23:49.886 --> 23:53.140
Next episode, "The Hunters."
